@baseUrl = http://localhost:5217/api/v1

### 1. Login to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "test-leaderboard-device"
}

### 2. Get global leaderboard (default: page 1, pageSize 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/global
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 3. Get global leaderboard with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/global?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 4. Get leaderboard page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/global?page=2&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 5. Get leaderboard with large page size (max 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/global?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 6. Get leaderboard without auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/global
